        "essentialcraft5:end_earth_infused_ore",
        "essentialcraft5:end_air_infused_ore"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "<em>目標</em>：把{item:essentialcraft5:fire_drops}、{item:essentialcraft5:water_drops}、{item:essentialcraft5:earth_drops}和{item:essentialcraft5:air_drops}四種都挖到手，它們統稱<em>魔晶</em>，是這個模組最基礎的材料。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "<em>蘊魔礦石</em>是把落下的 MRU 留在了身上的岩石。它和原版礦石一樣嵌在石頭裡，並不稀有，下礦或鑽洞時稍加留意就能碰到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "items",
          "items": [
            "essentialcraft5:elemental_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:fire_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:water_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:earth_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:air_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:nether_elemental_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:nether_fire_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:nether_water_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:nether_earth_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:nether_air_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:end_elemental_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:end_fire_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:end_water_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:end_earth_infused_ore",
            "essentialcraft5:end_air_infused_ore"
          ],
          "per_row": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "去哪挖"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "header": [
            "維度",
            "嵌在",
            "高度"
          ],
          "widths": [
            2,
            4,
            3
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "主世界",
              "石頭、花崗岩、閃長岩、安山岩",
              "y 0 以上，深板岩層裡沒有"
            ],
            [
              "地獄",
              "地獄岩",
              "上下都有"
            ],
            [
              "終界",
              "終界石",
              "上下都有"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "每個維度有五種，四種元素各一種，第五種是元素蘊魔礦石，直接掉{item:essentialcraft5:elemental_gem}，碰上了一定要挖，能省下合成它要用的魔晶。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "if": "cfg:general.hoanna.portal_enabled",
          "text": "海納爾的地下也有主世界這幾種礦，數量和主世界差不多，見[[hoanna/lands]]。"
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "怎麼挖"
        },
        {
          "type": "kv",
          "rows": [
            [
              "工具",
              "任何鎬都行，木鎬也可以，空手挖什麼也不掉"
            ],
            [
              "掉落",
              "1～2 顆對應的魔晶，外加 0～2 點經驗"
            ],
            [
              "幸運",
              "每級多掉一些，幸運 III 是 1～8 顆"
            ],
            [
              "絲綢之觸",
              "掉礦石本身"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "style": "good",
          "title": "做成的標誌",
          "text": "拿到第一顆魔晶時這一步就會打勾，但目標是四種都要，還得接著挖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "style": "warn",
          "title": "火之魔晶用得最快",
          "text": "一根{item:essentialcraft5:heating_rod}就要 6 顆{item:essentialcraft5:fire_drops}，前四章至少要做 5 根。到第五章為止，火之魔晶大約要 40 顆，另外三種各要十來顆，看到火之蘊魔礦石就挖，最好帶著幸運。"
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "if": "cfg:general.mobs.elemental_wisp.max_nearby>0",
          "style": "info",
          "title": "洞裡的元素遊靈",
          "text": "主世界 y {cfg:general.mobs.elemental_wisp.max_y} 以下的洞穴裡會飄出<em>元素遊靈</em>，它是哪種元素，看它在什麼群系出生。自己動手打死它，有一半的機率掉那種魔晶。沙漠、惡地底下的是火之遊靈。見[[bestiary/elemental_wisp]]。"
        },
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "style": "info",
          "title": "下一步",
          "text": "四種湊齊後去做[[elements/elemental_gem]]。哪一種總也挖不到，或者不想下礦，可以先看[[elements/rituals]]，用幾樣原版材料就能凝出魔晶。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rituals",
      "title": "地面儀式",
      "icon": "essentialcraft5:fire_drops_cluster",
      "summary": "不下礦也能凝聚魔晶",
